---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for ALiF Ladies Tailor & Boutique.">
  <div class="container-narrow section">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div style="line-height: 1.8; color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">1. Services</h3>
      <p>ALiF Ladies Tailor provides custom stitching, fabric sales, and design consultation. By placing an order, you agree to provide accurate measurements or visit our shop for measurements.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">2. Stitching &amp; Fittings</h3>
      <p>While we strive for the perfect fit, minor alterations may be required. We offer <strong>free alteration within 7 days</strong> of delivery if the fitting issue is due to our tailoring.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">3. Fabric Responsibility</h3>
      <p>If you provide your own fabric, please ensure it is of good quality. We are not responsible for shrinkage, color bleeding, or fabric defect.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">4. Delivery Timelines</h3>
      <p>Standard stitching takes 7–10 days. Urgent orders (minimum 24 hours) should be confirmed before placing the order. Delivery dates are estimates and may vary during festive seasons.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">5. Payments</h3>
      <p>Advance payment is optional. UPI payments are accepted up to ₹1,950. Remaining balance must be paid in cash upon delivery or pickup.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
